From uf2122b34f1aa6e95 at groups.google.com  Tue May 25 10:42:54 2021
From: uf2122b34f1aa6e95 at groups.google.com (Eric Rexstad)
Date: Tue, 25 May 2021 10:42:54 +0000
Subject: Re: [distance-sampling] point transect and left truncation
Message-ID: <nuC0JerV8f4.2NwxdG8JBQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <nuC0JerV8f4.a9qxO_8ABQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
References: <nuC0JerV8f4.3ZLDGTmuCAAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com> <nuC0JerV8f4.a9qxO_8ABQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
